  "worked_solution": "To find the $x$-intercepts, we plug $y=0$ and $z=0$ into the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+1)^{2}+\\frac{(0-2)^{2}}{8}+\\frac{(0+2)^{2}}{8} & =1 \\\\ (x+1)^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2} & =1 \\\\ (x+1)^{2} & =0 \\\\ x+1 & =0 \\\\ x & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we get the solution $x=-1.$\n\nTherefore, the intercept with the $x$-axis is $(-1,0,0)$ only.",
